---
title: Writeback reconciliation
---
flowchart TD
  paths[Legacy and current queues] --> order[Shared migration order]
  order --> queue[Append-only lifecycle rows]
  queue --> window[Keep rows through window end]
  window --> latest[Newest timestamp per ID]
  latest --> tie{Timestamps tie?}
  tie -->|Yes| append[Last appended row]
  tie -->|No| selected[Selected row]
  append --> selected
  selected --> context{Context matches?}
  context -->|No| excluded[Exclude selected state]
  context -->|Yes| kind[Normalize kind aliases]
  kind --> report[One state per ID]
